{"id":"c66da1dafd42a74f","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-pcf2-filter-equivalence.md","title":"ZFC Pcf2 Filter Equivalence","display":"df-zfc-pcf2-filter-equivalence — ZFC Pcf2 Filter Equivalence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-filter-equivalence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf2-filter-equivalence"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf2-filter-equivalence — ZFC Pcf2 Filter Equivalence","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-filter-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf2-filter-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf2-filter-equivalence — ZFC Pcf2 Filter Equivalence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6226ed6b29249a1a\" href=\"?note=6226ed6b29249a1a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set\">58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,F,f,g\\in V\">\\(A,F,f,g\\in V\\)</span> (index set, proper filter, and product functions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S\\)</span> (set-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6226ed6b29249a1a\" href=\"?note=6226ed6b29249a1a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set\">58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2FilterEquivalence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2FilterEquivalence}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}filter\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2FilterEquivalence}_S(A,F,f,g)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(A,F)\\land f\\in\\prod_{a\\in A}a\\land g\\in\\prod_{a\\in A}a\\land\\{a\\in A\\mid f(a)=g(a)\\}\\in F\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}filter\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2FilterEquivalence}_S(A,F,f,g)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(A,F)\\land f\\in\\prod_{a\\in A}a\\land g\\in\\prod_{a\\in A}a\\land\\{a\\in A\\mid f(a)=g(a)\\}\\in F\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equality modulo <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is restricted to the typed product, and the equalizer set is required to be <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>-large.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set","status":"resolved","id":"6226ed6b29249a1a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set","status":"resolved","id":"6226ed6b29249a1a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S$ (set-filter predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-filter6-filter-on-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,F,f,g\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2FilterEquivalence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}filter\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2FilterEquivalence}_S(A,F,f,g)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FilterOnSet}_S(A,F)\\land f\\in\\prod_{a\\in A}a\\land g\\in\\prod_{a\\in A}a\\land\\{a\\in A\\mid f(a)=g(a)\\}\\in F","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false}],"bytes":995,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3043","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-pcf2-filter-equivalence.md|58-df-zfc-pcf2-filter-equivalence]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["6226ed6b29249a1a"]}